8009 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 8010 0 R/Alt(Log-log plot of the electron-density turbulence power spectrum against wavenumber q in inverse metres, over almost 20 orders of magnitude in q. Data points from different observations, including Voyager 1 at the high-wavenumber end, follow a single dashed straight line, the Kolmogorov power law with slope minus 11 thirds, labelled P_3N = 10 to the minus 2.79 times (m q) to the minus 11 thirds. Small deviations appear only at the largest wavenumbers, near the ion and electron scales marked at the top.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 16210 0 R>>
endobj
